# OpenAPI Generator ignore list for the Go client in pkg/openapi.
#
# Source of truth: scripts/openapi-generator-ignore. `task generate-openapi-client` copies it to
# `.openapi-generator-ignore` in the (fresh) output directory before the generator runs, so the generator
# skips the files below. Edit scripts/openapi-generator-ignore only: the copy in pkg/openapi is replaced
# on every regeneration.
# The patterns follow .gitignore syntax.

# Scaffolding for publishing the client as a repository of its own; this client lives inside goRP.
.travis.yml
git_push.sh

# Index of docs/*.md files, which are not generated (modelDocs=false, apiDocs=false): every link in it is dead.
# api/openapi.yaml is deliberately kept: it is the only committed copy of the preprocessed spec the client was generated from.
README.md
